OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 28 MAR
OL,4,G1300FMusic Matters: Mark Radcliffe's
OL,5,     FChoral Odyssey
OL,6,     GMark Radcliffe discusses his
OL,7,     Gfavourite choral music, including
OL,8,     Gworks by Mozart, Ticheli, Barber
OL,9,     Gand Eric Whitacre.
OL,10,G1400FRecord Review
OL,11,     GAndrew McGregor with the best new
OL,12,     Gclassical releases, joined by
OL,13,     Gguest reviewers Jeremy Sams and
OL,14,     GAllyson Devenish, who picks her
OL,15,     Gfavourite recording of
OL,16,     GBeethoven's Waldstein Sonata.
OL,17,G1600FSound Of Cinema
OL,18,     GEdith Bowman showcases the finest
OL,19,     Gin film and television scores -
OL,20,     Gfeaturing a conversation with
OL,21,     Gcomposer Antony Genn and Stephen
OL,22,     GFry shares his Pick of the Flicks.
